td><td align="center">EU919305</td><td align="center">EU919378</td></tr><tr><td align="center">17</td><td align="left">Indonesia: North Sumatra (1&#x000b0;14' N, 97&#x000b0;23' E), 100 m*</td><td align="center">0.0056</td><td align="center">0.0211</td><td align="left">N/A</td><td align="left">102819</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919303</td><td align="center">EU919345</td></tr><tr><td align="center">18</td><td align="left">Indonesia: North Sumatra (1&#x000b0;14' N, 97&#x000b0;23' E), 100 m*</td><td align="center">0.0028</td><td align="center">0.0200</td><td align="left">N/A</td><td align="left">102820</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919334</td><td align="center">EU919369</td></tr><tr><td align="center">19</td><td align="left">Indonesia: West Sumatra (0&#x000b0;33' S, 100&#x000b0;21' E), 150 m</td><td align="center">0.0056</td><td align="center">0.0211</td><td align="left">3.VI.2007</td><td align="left">102821</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919284</td><td align="center">EU919396</td></tr><tr><td align="center">20</td><td align="left">Indonesia: West Sumatra (0&#x000b0;33' S, 100&#x000b0;21' E), 150 m</td><td align="center">0.0056</td><td align="center">0.0211</td><td align="left">3.VI.2007</td><td align="left">102822</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919317</td><td align="center">EU919382</td></tr><tr><td align="center">21</td><td align="left">Indonesia: Banka-Belitung (2&#x000b0;50' S, 107&#x000b0;55' E), 20 m*</td><td align="center">0.0028</td><td align="center">0.0200</td><td align="left">III.2006</td><td align="left">102823</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919329</td><td align="center">EU919387</td></tr><tr><td align="center">22</td><td align="left">Indonesia: Banka-Belitung (2&#x000b0;50' S, 107&#x000b0;55' E), 20 m*</td><td align="center">0.0033</td><td align="center">0.0206</td><td align="left">III.2006</td><td align="left">102824</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919286</td><td align="center">EU919354</td></tr><tr><td align="center">23</td><td align="left">Indonesia: Java (6&#x000b0;44' S, 106&#x000b0;33' E), 1000 m</td><td align="center">0.0028</td><td align="center">0.0200</td><td align="left">18.IV.2007</td><td align="left">102825</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919325</td><td align="center">EU919375</td></tr><tr><td align="center">24</td><td align="left">Indonesia: SE Sulawesi (4&#x000b0;45' N, 123&#x000b0;55' E), 150 m*</td><td align="center">0.0206</td><td align="center">0.0011</td><td align="left">N/A</td><td align="left">102826</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919313</td><td align="center">EU919343</td></tr><tr><td align="center">25</td><td align="left">Indonesia: SE Sulawesi (4&#x000b0;45' N, 123&#x000b0;55' E), 150 m*</td><td align="center">0.0039</td><td align="center">0.0189</td><td align="left">N/A</td><td align="left">102827</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919294</td><td align="center">EU919348</td></tr><tr><td align="center">26</td><td align="left">Indonesia: SE Sulawesi (5&#x000b0;00' S, 122&#x000b0;55' E), 300 m*</td><td align="center">0.0206</td><td align="center">0.0011</td><td align="left">N/A</td><td align="left">102828</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919339</td><td align="center">EU919380</td></tr><tr><td align="center">27</td><td align="left">Indonesia: Seram/Ambon (3&#x000b0;37' S, 128&#x000b0;10' E), 200 m*</td><td align="center">0.0039</td><td align="center">0.0189</td><td align="left">III.2005</td><td align="left">102829</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align="center">EU919321</td><td align="center">EU919395</td></tr><tr><td align="center">28</td><td align="left">Indonesia: South Sulawesi (4&#x000b0;00' S, 120&#x000b0;00' E), 150 m*</td><td align="center">0.0039</td><td align="center">0.0189</td><td align="left">IV.2005</td><td align="left">102830</td><td align="center">RMBR</td><td align